OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry but with widespread low
OL,6,Fcloud initially, turning brighter
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and feeling
OL,8,Fpleasant in any sunny spells. Showers
OL,9,Fdevelop into the afternoon, but these
OL,10,Fwill be more isolated and lighter than
OL,11,Fon Sunday. Freshening winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny lingering showers ease to
OL,14,Fleave a dry, partly cloudy evening.
OL,15,FCloud fills in overnight with further
OL,16,Fisolated showers across the western
OL,17,Fparts by dawn. Cooler than recent
OL,18,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
