OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FMostly cloudy to start with
OL,6,Fisolated showers in the west and
OL,7,Fbrighter spells in the east. Showers
OL,8,Fbecome more widespread at times, but
OL,9,Fmany places remain dry. Fresh winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fband of rain crosses the area through
OL,13,FWednesday, with blustery showers to
OL,14,Ffollow. Drier on Thursday before
OL,15,Ffurther rain then showers on Friday.
OL,16,FFresh winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
